{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":133590,"duration_api_ms":244903,"num_turns":13,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"69e03172-31fe-4fa0-9523-ecd0a9661676","total_cost_usd":0.88271895,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":56625,"cache_read_input_tokens":224554,"output_tokens":4311,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":56625,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":215,"outputTokens":15742,"cacheReadInputTokens":938157,"cacheCreationInputTokens":108784,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3087207,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":4311,"cacheReadInputTokens":224554,"cacheCreationInputTokens":56625,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.57399825,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["AC1 (named constants, single charge): NITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N = 2.0/14.007 and DENITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N = 1.0/14.007 are defined in process.rs with Stumm & Morgan citation. Alkalinity is charged only at AOB and comammox TAN-oxidation steps; NOB explicitly does not consume alkalinity (confirmed by code comment at nitrogen_cycle.rs:374-375 and dedicated test).","AC2 (cycling pH decline): `cycling_without_water_changes_shows_ph_decline` test passes — isolates alkalinity→pH pathway by zeroing growth yields and filter flow, running 96 simulated hours, and asserting pH decreased.","AC3 (soft-water vs hard-water buffering): `soft_water_declines_faster_than_hard_water` test passes — runs KH 2 and KH 8 tanks under identical ammonia load for 48 hours, asserts soft-water pH drop > hard-water pH drop.","AC4 (closed-system mass balance): `closed_system_alkalinity_mass_balance` test passes — verifies initial_alk - final_alk ≈ total_N_nitrified × NITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N within 10% tolerance (accounting for biomass growth routing). Also validates ratio of consumed alk to TAN is between 80%-105% of stoichiometric constant.","AC5 (budget/tracing visibility): Engine emits 5 budget metrics (water.alkalinity_meq.delta, tan_oxidized_mg, nitrate_produced_mg_n, alkalinity_consumed_meq, alkalinity_produced_meq) and 10 trace notes including per-guild breakdown. `tracing_shows_alkalinity_attribution` test validates both budget entries and trace notes contain alkalinity attribution. StageTrace::metric() is now guarded by budget_metrics_enabled flag (accepted amendment applied), with 2 dedicated unit tests verifying independent note/metric gating.","AC6 (denitrification return path): alkalinity_produced_meq field on NitrogenCycleOutput is wired as zero placeholder. DENITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N constant is defined, exported, and tested. net_alkalinity_delta_meq() helper computes produced - consumed. process.rs documentation provides explicit wiring instructions for E4b. Engine already emits produced metric, so denitrification only needs to populate the field.","Quality gates: cargo clippy -D warnings — clean. cargo fmt --check — clean. All 6 nitrification tests pass. All 20 tracing tests pass. All 24 budget tracking tests pass. 2 StageTrace unit tests pass.","Accepted amendments applied: (1) comammox now decrements alk_budget (nitrogen_cycle.rs:351) with debug_assert on invariant; (2) StageTrace::metric() guarded by budget_metrics_enabled flag (engine.rs:100).","Pre-existing failure: save_load_with_active_cycle_state (save_load.rs:368) is a floating-point determinism issue in save/load round-trips, present before this work and acknowledged in both prior stage outputs — not introduced or worsened by this change set."],"findings_or_gaps":["alkalinity_produced_meq remains a zero-valued placeholder until denitrification lands (E4b). This is expected and documented — the interface is ready but production is not yet implemented.","The save_load_with_active_cycle_state test failure is pre-existing and out of scope for this bead, but should be tracked separately to prevent it from masking future regressions in the broader suite."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"13c75043-f0d5-4583-9054-1efd4ffe66d1"}
